      "title_zh": "忘了拿钱",
      "title_en": "I forgot my money",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["今天", "我", "去", "买", "东西", "。", "我", "拿", "了", "很", "多", "东西", "。", "这些", "东西", "都", "是", "我", "要", "用", "的", "。"],
        ["要", "给", "钱", "了", "，", "我", "想", "起来", "：", "钱", "在", "家里", "！", "我", "忘", "了", "拿", "钱", "！"],
        ["我", "说", "：", "“", "我", "回家", "拿", "钱", "，", "马上", "回来", "！", "”"],
        ["那里", "的", "人", "笑", "了", "，", "说", "：", "“", "不用", "，", "你", "用", "手机", "给", "就", "行", "。", "”"],
        ["我", "也", "笑", "了", "：", "我", "有", "手机", "！", "我", "用", "手机", "给", "了", "钱", "，", "就", "回家", "了", "。"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "Today I went shopping. I picked up lots of things — all things I need.",
        "When it was time to pay, I remembered: my money was at home! I'd forgotten to bring it!",
        "I said: “I’ll go home and get my money — I’ll be right back!”",
        "The person there laughed and said: “No need — you can just pay with your phone.”",
        "I laughed too: I had my phone! I paid with my phone and went home."
      ],
